# The ONE place every pinned tool version is written (subfinder, nuclei, template pack).
#
# Read by the Dockerfile (it sources this file for `go install ...@v<pin>` and the pack clone) and by
# `risklence-scanner install-tools` (scanner_agent/tool_pins.py), so a container
# and a local install always carry the same reviewed tools. Bumping one is a
# deliberate, reviewed change: also add the new sha256 values to RELEASE_SHA256 /
# TEMPLATE_PACK_SHA256 in tool_installer_constants.py (a test fails until you do).
# Procedure: apps/scanner/README.md, "Updating tools".
# Plain KEY=value lines only: it is sourced by `sh`.
NUCLEI_TEMPLATES_VERSION=v10.4.7
SUBFINDER_VERSION=2.16.0
NUCLEI_VERSION=3.11.1
